      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST NOT",
      "cml:premiseText": "A person is not taken to be directly or indirectly knowingly concerned in, or party to, a contravention of section 44ZZW or 44ZZX merely because the person is a recipient of information disclosed in contravention of that section."
